  m_text: "\"Sudal-E combines 'Sudal' (the Korean word for otter) and 'Environment.'
    \nSet against the backdrop of Daegu\u2014the host city of IEEE VR 2026\u2014it
    is an interactive AR application where users rescue endangered otters, purify
    polluted ecosystems, and experience the vital importance of environmental conservation.\""
